==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GenAm}} {{IPA|/ˌɹuːdɪˈmɛntəɹi/|/ˌɹuːdɪˈmɛnt͡ʃɹi/|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Of or relating to one or more [[rudiment]]s.
#: ''I have only a '''rudimentary''' grasp of chemistry''.
# [[basic|Basic]]; [[minimal]]; with less than, or only the [[minimum]], [[necessary]].
#: ''His grasp of '''rudimentary''' English allowed him at least to do the shopping''.
#: ''His '''rudimentary''' driving skills meant that he was a danger on the road''.

